    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, we're looking to move away from SMS-based MFA at my firm because of the SIM swapping risks. Can you walk me through the steps for implementing hardware security keys like YubiKeys for our staff instead? We need to get this rolled out across the whole office.",
