      "content": "During the transition, you are in a vulnerable state, so you must maintain layered defenses. It's critical to keep your existing SMS MFA active *alongside* the new hardware key enrollment for a defined period. This dual-layer approach acts as a safety net, preventing a full lockout if a key is lost or if the new system has a temporary glitch. Furthermore, ensure that all privileged accounts are the absolute last to migrate, and that you are aggressively monitoring for any anomalous login attempts during the rollout phase.",
